# Room 6: the Data Center. A castle with no windows (one, for the meter
# reader) whose front wall is a server rack: seams, status lights, fans.
# The moat runs along the south. The power plant is upstream, on the hill.
# Outlines first, fills after, then small details drawn over the fills.

